alse, "novel_title": "凤逆天:杀手狂妃", "content_zh": "第二章 同归于尽“碰！”不等夜御天说完，凰冷月的拳头就先一步击向了他得意的脸。夜御天冷不防凰冷月来势凶猛的一拳，一头向后栽倒在地。“去死！”凰冷月一个漂亮的横劈，修长的腿重重踢到了夜御天的腰间。夜御天闷哼一声，被这一招快速无比的招式踢得滚出好几米远。在武功上，没有几个人有尊凰凰冷月的快和狠。只是夜御天没想到她中了致命病毒后，竟然这么悍不畏死，怒吼：“凰冷月，你敢动我，你就活不过24小时！”“那就一起死！”凰冷月呸了他一口，一个箭步扑向操纵台。飞快按下一个按钮。忽然，无人驾驶飞机开始发出嘀嘀的警报声。“你干什么？”夜御天脸色一变。凰冷月飞快退后一步，冷笑：“夜御天，你知道吗？我最讨厌性命握在别人手里。你想要我的地库密码，想要那些财富和武器。去地狱拿吧！”飞机在飞速下落。机舱中一片颠簸。夜御天疯了一样冲上控制台，拼命去按按钮可是根本没用。“你个贱人！”夜御天疯了，狠狠掐着凰冷月的脖子：“快把飞机弄回来。”凰冷月呵呵一笑，她能感觉到身体被致命病毒开始在急速破坏着。她中的致命病毒没有解药。她才没这么傻又一次相信这个男人。“夜御天……傻眼了吧？这飞机是我尊凰制造的。我让它……毁灭，它就毁灭……哈哈……”在剧烈颠簸中，她笑得惊心动魄地美。夜御天绝望地看着海平面越来越近。“如果有来世，我一定不会爱上任何一个男人！我要为自己而活……”凰冷月最后吐出一句话。“轰”地一声，飞机重重摔入海面，彻底爆炸解体……与此同时，一道诡异的白光掠过海面，一道几乎看不见的娇俏人影迅速消失在海平面上…………此时忘川大陆，西川国，护国公府邸。火红的喜字高挂，烛光闪闪。床帏摇曳，榻上女子一脸苍白，双目紧闭，绝美无暇。“大哥，你瞧这张脸，可是嫩的很呐！”塌旁，一醉汉口水直流，满脸猥琐的望着榻上女子。“呵，再怎么嫩，也是不过是宁王府的一介草包，就算高攀了魅国公，还不是个小妾？她以为这样就可以飞上枝头变凤凰？”说话的也是一名醉汉，此刻正脸色潮红，醉眼迷离的朝着榻侧而去。吵闹声入耳，凰冷月意识回笼，双眸嗖的如电光般睁开。两名醉意朦胧的家丁正欲伸手撕凰冷月的衣襟，却被凰冷月猛然睁开的双眼给吓的一怔。仅一秒，凰冷月见状条件反射的一把扯住两醉汉的胳膊，迅猛一摔。“砰”“砰”大汉各有二百斤重，却被凰冷月一把狠狠摔在地上。凰冷月已然慵懒的站立在醉汉面前，俯瞰二人，冷声道，“你们是什么人？”忽然，她话还没说完一阵剧痛从脑中传来。她痛得急忙伸手扶额头。可当她手刚摸到额头时，一股强大的记忆波呼啸而来……", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2: Die together \"Bump!\" Before Ye Yutian could finish speaking, Huang Lengyue's fist hit his proud face first. Ye Yutian Leng was caught off guard by Huang Lengyue's fierce punch and fell backwards to the ground. \"Go to hell!\" Huang Lengyue made a beautiful horizontal chop and kicked Ye Yutian hard on the waist with her long legs. Ye Yutian groaned and was kicked several meters away by this extremely fast move. In terms of martial arts, few people are as quick and ruthless as Zunhuanghuang Lengyue. It's just that Ye Yutian didn't expect that after she was infected with the deadly virus, she would be so brave and unafraid of death, roaring: \"Huang Lengyue, if you dare to touch me, you won't survive 24 hours!\" \"Then let's die together!\" Huang Lengyue pouted at him and lunged towards the console.飞快按下一个按钮。 Suddenly, the drone started beeping sirens. “你干什么？”夜御天脸色一变。 Huang Lengyue quickly took a step back and sneered: \"Ye Yutian, do you know? I hate it when my life is in other people's hands. You want my basement password, the wealth and weapons. Go to hell and get it!\" The plane was falling rapidly. There was a turbulence in the cabin. Ye Yutian rushed to the console like a madman and pressed the buttons with all his strength, but it was useless. \"You bitch!\" Ye Yutian went crazy and pinched Huang Lengyue's neck: \"Get the plane back quickly.\" Huang Lengyue chuckled. She could feel that her body was being rapidly destroyed by the deadly virus.她中的致命病毒没有解药。她才没这么傻又一次相信这个男人。 \"Ye Yutian...are you dumbfounded? This plane was made by me, Zunhuang. If I let it... be destroyed, it will be destroyed... haha...\" Amidst the violent turbulence, she smiled breathtakingly beautiful.夜御天绝望地看着海平面越来越近。 \"If there is an afterlife, I will never fall in love with any man! I want to live for myself...\" Huang Lengyue uttered the last sentence. With a \"boom\", the plane fell heavily into the sea, completely exploded and disintegrated... At the same time, a strange white light swept across the sea, and an almost invisible and pretty figure quickly disappeared on the sea level... At this time, Wangchuan Continent, Xichuan Kingdom, the residence of the Protector.火红的喜字高挂，烛光闪闪。 The bed curtains swayed, and the woman on the couch looked pale, her eyes closed, and she was absolutely beautiful. \"Brother, look at this face, it's so tender!\" Next to him, a drunk man drooled, looking at the woman on the couch with a lewd look on his face. \"Oh, no matter how young she is, she is just a straw bag in Prince Ning's palace. Even if she has become the master of Duke Mei, she is still not a concubine? Does she think she can fly on a branch and become a phoenix?\" The speaker was also a drunk man, his face was flushed at the moment, and he was walking towards the side of the couch with drunken eyes. After hearing the noise, Huang Lengyue's consciousness returned, and her eyes opened like lightning. The two drunken servants were about to stretch out their hands to tear off Huang Lengyue's clothes, but were startled when Huang Lengyue's eyes suddenly opened. In just one second, Huang Lengyue reflexively grabbed the arms of the two drunkards and threw them violently. \"Bang\" \"Bang\" The big man weighed two hundred kilograms each, but was thrown to the ground by Huang Lengyue. Huang Lengyue stood lazily in front of the drunk man, looking down at the two of them, and said coldly, \"Who are you?\" Suddenly, before she could finish her words, a sharp pain came from her head.她痛得急忙伸手扶额头。 But as soon as her hand touched her forehead, a powerful wave of memory roared over...", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}